<title>BELGIUM: EU reviews Schweizer Re takeover of Mercantile.</title>
<headline>EU reviews Schweizer Re takeover of Mercantile.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it was starting a routine probe into a proposal by Schweizer Rueckversicherungs-gesellschaft to acquire the control of the whole of  Mercantile and General Reinsurance Company Ltd.</p>
<p>Both companies are active in the reinsurance sector.</p>
<p>The deal was notified to the Commission for clearance on September 27, it said in a statement. It added that at first sight it could fall under the European Union's merger regulation, which bans creation and strengthening of dominant positions.</p>
<p>It has about a month to clear the operation or start a four-month in-depth probe. -- Brussels newsroom 322 2876841</p>
</text>
